  "body": "### What problem are you trying to solve?\n\nThe `showPopover`/`togglePopover` allows us to create implicit anchor reference via the `source` parameter, which comes handy in lot of cases (especially in ShadowDOM), but its drawback that we can't link the popover element to multiple anchors.\n\nFor example, with the following CSS:\n```css\n.popover-element {\n\tposition: absolute;\n\tbackground-color: #1900ff79;\n\ttop: anchor(--anchor-1 top);\n\tleft: anchor(--anchor-1 left);\n\tright: anchor(--anchor-2 right);\n\tbottom: anchor(--anchor-2 bottom);\n}\n```\nwe can position the popover to multiple anchors\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/46fae4a6-fd7e-4a07-957b-340765316435)\n\n### What solutions exist today?\n\n_No response_\n\n### How would you solve it?\n\n_No response_\n\n### Anything else?\n\n_No response_",
